不接鄭子產，原憲子思不接孔子後世子思；名錄各條同字子徒、子聲、子上、皙等均保留不同候選，鄭國是此條人名。魯昭公夫人孟子不接戰國孟子。全152段明示姓名首輪已存，未名者、代詞、版本及跨篇身份待覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p001","text":"孔子曰「受業身通者七十有七人」，皆異能之士也。德行：顏淵，閔子騫，冉伯牛，仲弓。政事：冉有，季路。言語：宰我，子貢。文學：子游，子夏。師也辟，參也魯，柴也愚，由也喭，回也屢空。賜不受命而貨殖焉，億則屢中。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0004","start":4,"end":9,"surface":"受業身通者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、氏族或未定指代，尚未補姓名及成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0017","start":17,"end":21,"surface":"異能之士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、氏族或未定指代，尚未補姓名及成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"顏淵","kind":"person","person_id":"gsq_vgq_esv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"閔子騫","kind":"person","person_id":"we8_mkq_luc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"冉伯牛","kind":"person","person_id":"n7v_qo9_v4f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"仲弓","kind":"person","person_id":"5bo_dxd_69k_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"冉有","kind":"person","person_id":"wnp_vk6_qhe","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"季路","kind":"person","person_id":"t7x_2x7_1fc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"宰我","kind":"person","person_id":"sng_c8u_vn9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m001-0